#Lua SEXPs


$Operator: dialogue-load-script
$Category: Change
$Subcategory: LUA-Dialogue
$Minimum Arguments: 1
$Return Type: Nothing
$Description: This sexp loads the specified conversation and begins the script. Note, this sexp only works in singelplayer.
$Parameter: 
	+Description: Key name of the conversation table within the DialogueConversations LUA table. 
	+Type: String

$Operator: dialogue-set-sender-ship
$Category: Change
$Subcategory: LUA-Dialogue
$Minimum Arguments: 0
$Return Type: Nothing
$Description: This sexp sets the sender of the dialogue. Note, this sexp only works in singelplayer.
$Parameter: 
	+Description: Ship that will send the dialogue messages. If blank Command will send the messages. 
	+Type: Ship

$Operator: dialogue-set-choice-title
$Category: Change
$Subcategory: LUA-Dialogue
$Minimum Arguments: 1
$Return Type: Nothing
$Description: This sexp sets the title of the choice HUD gauge. Note, this sexp only works in singelplayer.
$Parameter: 
	+Description: New name of the title of the HUD gauge that displays choices. 
	+Type: String

#End